  "prefLabel": "Odb 402.22 Property damage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 402.22 “Property damage” means physical damage to, or loss of use of, tangible property owned by a party other than the facility owner or his or her employees.\n\nSource. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
